# Mor Ul Rek by the Fight Cave's mouth, for the rotation clock. The cave's entrance is in Mor Ul
# Rek (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/TzHaar_Fight_Cave); its map regions are 9808, 9807, 10064 and
# 10063, as RuneLite's Discord plugin lists them (DiscordGameEventType.CITY_MOR_UL_REK). Region
# 9808 runs from 2432,5120 to 2495,5183. Schematic: an open floor, no city.
#
# The game's clock (net.runelite.api.gameval): VarPlayerID.DATE_MINUTES, minutes since midnight,
# and VarbitID.DATE_SECONDS_PAST_MINUTE.

scene 2420 5110
skill ATTACK 70
skill STRENGTH 70
skill DEFENCE 70
skill HITPOINTS 70
skill RANGED 75
skill PRAYER 43
at 2460 5150

watch clock clockPlaque.shown.rotation
watch next clockPlaque.shown.next
watch line clockPlaque.shown.line
watch figure plaque.shown.figure
watch note plaque.shown.note
watch clockChecks book.clock.size
watch clockSaid book.clock.0.said
watch clockHit book.clock.0.hit
